's session language","fullName":"tests.test_game_engine_lifecycle#test_start_game_builds_data_miner_with_session_language"},"descriptionHtml":"<p>DataMiner constructed during setting research must localise to the engine's session language.</p>\n<pre><code>Regression guard: earlier versions built the initial DataMiner with the default ``language=&quot;English&quot;``,\nso a Russian session received English setting data and every downstream agent's system prompt ended up\nlayered over an English summary. Cross-check against ``wire_director``'s ``data_miner or DataMiner(...)``\nshort-circuit — the pre-built instance wins, so it must be localised here at construction time.\n</code></pre>\n","environment":"default","setup":[{"id":"761290a0b70045dfbe26a6cb958889c3","type":"before","name":"simple_setting","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"c7baa2c1907b0c83cb2c7bc311a9e4f4","type":"before","name":"event_loop_policy","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"20b7e0da9c48d618376543c2a30bcbe9","type":"before","name":"_install_log_scrubber","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1},{"id":"5188cd43996a3fd44c485cc83aa3242e","type":"before","name":"_function_scoped_runner","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0}],"teardown":[{"id":"c8eb43e7ee72171c3fdc28077808d91a","type":"after","name":"_install_log_scrubber::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":0},{"id":"6ea5fd63a487d24fb702ccb277f2cdcb","type":"after","name":"_function_scoped_runner::0","status":"passed","steps":[],"duration":1}],"history":[],"retries":[],"breadcrumbs":[["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle"]],"retry":false,"titlePath":["tests","test_game_engine_lifecycle.py"],"retriesCount":0,"attachments":[{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"fca723801e9a1b00157e954ff2953f88","originalFileName":"79e25bf1-11ee-45cf-a6e7-a46115cbdebb-attachment.txt","ext":".txt","contentType":"text/plain","contentLength":68,"name":"log"},"type":"attachment"},{"link":{"used":true,"missed":false,"id":"0a85a8eb